B.CB=new A.a2("pendulum-four","To make a pendulum swing twice as slowly, how much longer must it be?","Four times as long",B.Oe,"Swing time goes with the square root of the length, so double the time needs four times the length.",2,"\ud83d\udccf4\ufe0f\u20e3|Longer")
