B.B7=new A.a2("ferro-lines","Why are the spikes in lines?","The iron bits line up along the magnet's field",B.P2,"Each tiny bit lines up along the magnetic field, and the bits stack up into spikes.",1,"\ud83e\uddf2|Field lines")
